{"name":"The Bindtok Lamp","slug":"glyph-bindtok-lamp","blurb":"On the voice street, True carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Bindtok. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Bindtok Lamp.","seal":"4cdc505a38b32255a872d98cb277775dea1fdaeae9bbde3727a12f756b8c20ea"}
